From f142e58d06a458b72cf7ea27999c093ca87c9c2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ephico2real2 <ephico2real@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 09:09:50 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ztunnel: retain live strict capture until endpoint recreation

Reject live strict unenrollment before touching rules or queuing DEL. Defer namespace-wide removal while live endpoints remain; exact endpoint deletion still owns sandbox retirement. This is a conservative hold while desired and active per-Pod membership are separated.

Local Podman ARM64 validation: 127 affected unit, race and actual privileged cases with zero skips, vet and configured lint. Exact-image namespace transition/restart qualification follows; hot unenrollment and availability across relabel remain open.

Signed-off-by: ephico2real2 <ephico2real@gmail.com>
